hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2758","###\n Abdullah bin Hashim narrated to us, saying: Bahz, meaning the son of Asad, narrated to us, saying: Sulaiman bin Al-Mughirah narrated to us, from Thabit, who said: Abdullah bin Rabah narrated to us, saying: Delegations arrived at Mu'awiyah's presence, and I was among them along with Abu Hurairah. This occurred during the month of Ramadan. He then mentioned a long hadith concerning the Conquest of Makkah. Abu Hurairah said: \""
